David: "Since I maintained the daily digital probe temperature logs, blast-chiller records, and HACCP compliance sheets throughout the placement, I will write the food safety audit section."

Gemma: "And I have all the wholesale supplier invoices and portion-weight spreadsheets, so I will calculate the food cost margins and gross profit yield percentages for all twelve main courses."

David: "Regarding the seasonal menu design proposal: since Gemma conducted the customer feedback survey on plant-based and gluten-free autumn dishes, she agreed to draft the menu design proposal."

